    "id": "post_li_02",
    "title": "How a door gets finished here, in four passes",
    "content": "Four passes, no shortcuts. Seal, sand, colour, sand, two clear coats with a flat-sand between them, then a week on the rack before it ships. That week is why the finish still looks new when the mortgage is paid off. #BrightsideBuilt",
